              "content": "Finder’s own synthesised rows — iCloud Drive, Computer, AirDrop, Network, the cloud-provider rows — cannot take a custom icon at all; macOS stores one and never draws it, so the app leaves them alone.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$sans",
              "fontSize": 13
