                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Pasted a custom icon into Get Info so the folder is recognisable in the Dock? On macOS 26 that icon fights the sidebar glyph. When you add such a folder the app says so and offers three ways out — none does anything until you save.",
