                  "name": "Sub",
                  "fill": "#B9B2A6",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Every row in Finder’s Favorites can carry a private per-item property holding a four-character code that Launch Services resolves to an icon. SidebarFavorites allocates one code per favorite and installs a single tiny helper bundle that declares them.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$sans",
                  "fontSize": 17
                }
              ]
