      "id": "JJGAF",
      "x": -393,
      "y": 811,
      "name": "Build note — demo video",
      "width": 320,
      "height": 170,
      "content": "BUILD: SidebarFavorites needs its own demo recording in the same style as the WebWatcher demo (README asset https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8adbf24e-0b20-4d1a-8bc1-d2593f2a02f7 — same length ≈ 40 s, same framing and captions): add a folder, pick an SF Symbol, Add → the sidebar updates; then an SVG import with the size slider. Hosted the same way (GitHub asset or the repo's docs/assets), muted autoplay loop with a play overlay. The WebWatcher video itself cannot be reused here — it shows the other product."
    }
